"Remendo exigido: <ulink url=\"&patch-root;/openbox-&openbox-"
"version;-py3-1.patch\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:76
#, xml-text
msgid "Openbox Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências do &quot;Openbox&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Exigidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"x-window-system\"/> and <xref linkend=\"pango\"/> (compiled "
"with support for libXft)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"x-window-system\"/> e <xref linkend=\"pango\"/> (compilado "
"com suporte para &quot;libXft&quot;)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#.  used for openbox-xdg-autostart
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:86
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dbus\"/> (runtime), <xref "
"linkend=\"imlib2\"/> (to enable icons in the right click menu), <xref "
"linkend=\"imagemagick\"/> (to show desktop backgrounds as seen in the "
"Configuration Information section below), <xref linkend=\"pyxdg\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"startup-notification\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"librsvg\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dbus\"/> (tempo de execução), <xref "
"linkend=\"imlib2\"/> (para habilitar ícones no menu do botão direito), <xref"
" linkend=\"imagemagick\"/> (para mostrar os planos de fundo da área de "
"trabalho conforme visto na seção Informações de Configuração abaixo), <xref "
"linkend=\"pyxdg\"/>, <xref linkend=\"startup-notification\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"librsvg\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Openbox"
msgstr "Instalação do Openbox"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If XORG_PREFIX is not <filename class='directory'>/usr</filename>, tell "
"<command>gcc</command> about it:"
msgstr ""
"se &quot;XORG_PREFIX&quot; não for &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>&quot;, [então] informe ao "
"&quot;<command>gcc</command>&quot; acerca disso:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:106
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export LIBRARY_PATH=$XORG_PREFIX/lib</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export LIBRARY_PATH=$XORG_PREFIX/lib</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Update the package scripts to enable Python 3:"
msgstr ""
"Atualize os conjuntos de comandos sequenciais do pacote para habilitar o "
"Python 3:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../openbox-&openbox-"
"version;-py3-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../openbox-&openbox-"
"version;-py3-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Openbox</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Openbox</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>autoreconf -fi &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/openbox-&openbox-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>autoreconf -fi &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/openbox-&openbox-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package creates three <filename>.desktop</filename> files in the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/xsessions/</filename> directory.  "
"Two of these are not appropriate in a BLFS system, so prevent the extra "
"files showing up as options in a display manager.  As the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote cria três arquivos &quot;<filename>.desktop</filename>&quot; no "
"diretório &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/xsessions/</filename>&quot;. Dois deles não "
"são apropriados em um sistema BLFS, de forma que evite os arquivos extras "
"aparecendo como opções em um gerenciador de tela. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;&root;&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm -v "
"/usr/share/xsessions/openbox-{gnome,kde}.desktop</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -v "
"/usr/share/xsessions/openbox-{gnome,kde}.desktop</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc</parameter>: This option puts "
"<application>Openbox</application>'s configuration files in /etc/xdg/openbox"
" instead of /usr/etc/xdg/openbox."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc</parameter>: Essa opção coloca os arquivos de "
"configuração do &quot;<application>Openbox</application>&quot; em "
"&quot;/etc/xdg/openbox&quot; em vez de &quot;/usr/etc/xdg/openbox&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--docdir=/usr/share/doc/openbox-&openbox-version;</parameter>: "
"this puts a few files in a versioned directory in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/doc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--docdir=/usr/share/doc/openbox-&openbox-version;</parameter>: "
"isso coloca alguns arquivos em um diretório versionado em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/doc</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Openbox"
msgstr "Configurando Openbox"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/autostart</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml</filename>, "
