"<filename>~/.config/openbox/autostart</filename>, "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/menu.xml</filename> and "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/rc.xml</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/autostart</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/rc.xml</filename>, "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/autostart</filename>, "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/menu.xml</filename> e "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/rc.xml</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.config/openbox/autostart"
msgstr "~/.config/openbox/autostart"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.config/openbox/menu.xml"
msgstr "~/.config/openbox/menu.xml"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.config/openbox/rc.xml"
msgstr "~/.config/openbox/rc.xml"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/xdg/openbox/autostart"
msgstr "/etc/xdg/openbox/autostart"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml"
msgstr "/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/xdg/openbox/rc.xml"
msgstr "/etc/xdg/openbox/rc.xml"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Openbox</application>'s right click menu can be used to launch "
"programs. The menu itself is configured with 2 files, "
"<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml</filename> and "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/menu.xml</filename>. To make changes to the "
"menu, copy /etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml to ~/.config/openbox/menu.xml and edit "
"it:"
msgstr ""
"O menu do botão direito do &quot;<application>Openbox</application>&quot; "
"pode ser usado para iniciar aplicativos. O menu em si é configurado com dois"
" arquivos, &quot;<filename>/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml</filename>&quot; e "
"&quot;<filename>~/.config/openbox/menu.xml</filename>&quot;. Para fazer "
"mudanças no menu, copie &quot;/etc/xdg/openbox/menu.xml&quot; para "
"&quot;~/.config/openbox/menu.xml&quot; e edite-o:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:220
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>cp -rf /etc/xdg/openbox ~/.config</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>cp -rf /etc/xdg/openbox ~/.config</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To have icons in your right click menu requires installing <xref "
"linkend=\"imlib2\"/> before you install <application>Openbox</application>. "
"To set an icon for an entry in the menu edit "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/menu.xml</filename> and add an icon to the "
"&lt;item&gt; tag like this:"
msgstr ""
"Para ter ícones em teu menu do botão direito, é exigido instalar o "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"imlib2\"/>&quot; antes de instalar o "
"&quot;<application>Openbox</application>&quot;. Para configurar um ícone "
"para uma entrada no menu, edite "
"&quot;<filename>~/.config/openbox/menu.xml</filename>&quot; e adicione um "
"ícone à marca &lt;item&gt;, assim:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:238
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "&lt;item label=\"Mplayer\" icon=\"/usr/share/pixmaps/mplayer.png\"&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;item label=\"Mplayer\" icon=\"/usr/share/pixmaps/mplayer.png\"&gt;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Many other aspects of <application>Openbox</application>'s behavior are "
"configured with <filename>~/.config/openbox/rc.xml</filename> such as what "
"keybindings are used to launch programs or which mouse button launches the "
"main menu."
msgstr ""
"Muitos outros aspectos do comportamento do "
"&quot;<application>Openbox</application>&quot; são configurados com "
"&quot;<filename>~/.config/openbox/rc.xml</filename>&quot;, como quais "
"atalhos de teclado são usados para iniciar aplicativos ou qual botão do "
"mouse inicia o menu principal."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Details of the theme that <application>Openbox</application> applies to "
"window decorations are configured in "
"<filename>~/.config/openbox/rc.xml</filename>. You can get a list of the "
"available themes with the command:"
msgstr ""
"Detalhes do tema que o &quot;<application>Openbox</application>&quot; aplica"
" às decorações de janelas são configurados em "
"&quot;<filename>~/.config/openbox/rc.xml</filename>&quot;. Você consegue "
"obter uma lista dos temas disponíveis com o comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:254
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ls -d /usr/share/themes/*/openbox-3 | sed "
"'s#.*es/##;s#/o.*##'</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ls -d /usr/share/themes/*/openbox-3 | sed "
"'s#.*es/##;s#/o.*##'</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "Starting Openbox"
msgstr "Iniciando Openbox"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:261
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start <command>openbox</command> when you start "
"<application>Xorg</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar automaticamente o &quot;<command>openbox</command>&quot; quando"
" você iniciar o &quot;<application>Xorg</application>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:265
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>echo openbox &gt; ~/.xinitrc</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>echo openbox &gt; ~/.xinitrc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to set a background image to your desktop you can use <xref "
"linkend=\"display\"/> and launch it from ~/.xinitrc just before openbox:"
msgstr ""
"Se quiser configurar uma imagem de plano de fundo para a tua área de "
"trabalho, [então] você pode usar o &quot;<xref linkend=\"display\"/>&quot; e"
" iniciá-lo a partir de &quot;~/.xinitrc&quot; logo antes do "
"&quot;openbox&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:273
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>display -backdrop -window root /path/to/beautiful/picture.jpeg\n"
"exec openbox</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>display -backdrop -window root /caminho/para/maravilhosa/fotografia.jpeg\n"
"exec openbox</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Or if you like a bit of variety, put a selection of images in a folder (in "
"this example, the directory ~/.config/backgrounds) and choose one at random "
"each time you <command>xinit</command>:"
msgstr ""
"Ou, se você gosta de um pouco de variedade, [então] coloque uma seleção de "
"imagens em uma pasta (neste exemplo, o diretório "
"&quot;~/.config/backgrounds&quot;) e escolha uma aleatoriamente cada vez que"
" você acionar o &quot;<command>xinit</command>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:284
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># make an array which lists the pictures:\n"
"picture_list=(~/.config/backgrounds/*)\n"
"# create a random integer between 0 and the number of pictures:\n"
"random_number=$(( ${RANDOM} % ${#picture_list[@]} ))\n"
"# display the chosen picture:\n"
"display -backdrop -window root \"${picture_list[${random_number}]}\"\n"
"exec openbox</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># crie um vetor que liste as fotografias:\n"
"picture_list=(~/.config/backgrounds/*)\n"
"# crie um número inteiro aleatório entre zero e o número de fotografias:\n"
"random_number=$(( ${RANDOM} % ${#picture_list[@]} ))\n"
"# exibir a fotografia escolhida:\n"
"display -backdrop -window root \"${picture_list[${random_number}]}\"\n"
"exec openbox</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#.  13-12-11 numlockx not found on the KDE website. This URL is OK ?
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:295
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you like to have the numlock key set when you start Xorg, install <ulink "
"url= "
"\"https://ftp.debian.org/debian/pool/main/n/numlockx/numlockx_1.2.orig.tar.gz\">"
" Numlockx</ulink> and add that to your xinitrc. Another useful application "
"is <xref linkend=\"dbus\"/>:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja ter a chave &quot;numlock&quot; configurada quando iniciar o "
"&quot;Xorg&quot;, [então] instale o &quot;<ulink url= "
"\"https://ftp.debian.org/debian/pool/main/n/numlockx/numlockx_1.2.orig.tar.gz\">Numlockx</ulink>&quot;"
" e adicione-o ao teu &quot;xinitrc&quot;. Outra aplicação útil é o "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"dbus\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/openbox.xml:303
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>. /etc/profile\n"
"picture_list=(~/.config/backgrounds/*)\n"
"random_number=$(( ${RANDOM} % ${#picture_list[*]} ))\n"
"display -backdrop -window root \"${picture_list[${random_number}]}\"\n"
"numlockx\n"
"eval $(dbus-launch --auto-syntax --exit-with-session)\n"
"lxpanel &amp;\n"
"exec openbox</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>. /etc/profile\n"
"picture_list=(~/.config/backgrounds/*)\n"
"random_number=$(( ${RANDOM} % ${#picture_list[*]} ))\n"
"display -backdrop -window root \"${picture_list[${random_number}]}\"\n"
"numlockx\n"
"eval $(dbus-launch --auto-syntax --exit-with-session)\n"
"lxpanel &amp;\n"
"exec openbox</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

